    "title": "Finn Digital Darkness Battle",
    "description": "Are you in the mood for Friday rap battles? This night, We'll bring to you a funny music arrow game with digital rhythm battles and several funny friends (BF,GF, and Finn). This time, BF will have to fight for his life in purple circus once again. Let our new guys Finn and Jake help your weekend be better.\r\n\r\nHOW TO WIN?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Indie cross, Kaine, El Chavo, silly billy, twiddlefiger), climb on top rank.\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow amazing melody\r\n- Full mod and enemies as you expected (Suicide Mouse, silly billy, twiddlefiger, Ourple guy)\r\n- Amazing other characters, beautiful background from all weeks in setting mode for you to design your own funny rap battle.\r\n- More than 7 catchy songs to entertain yourself.\r\n\r\nHave fun!",
